  "rationale": {
    "zh-CN": "肝右动脉绕入三角（毛虫驼峰）。三角清空前它像进入胆囊颈的动脉；真正的胆囊动脉很短，三角几乎完全清空后才显露。夹闭驼峰即为血管损伤。",
    "en": "The right hepatic artery loops into the triangle (caterpillar hump). Until the triangle is cleared it looks like an artery entering the neck; the true cystic artery is short and only shows when the triangle is nearly clear. Clipping the hump is a vascular injury."
  }
